# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-11-28 07:05

# game/case08.rpy:62
translate japanese press_reimu_1_06e07d27:

    # you "What exactly do the charms do?"
    you "そのお守りは、具体的に何をするのですか？"

# game/case08.rpy:63
translate japanese press_reimu_1_1d04c4b4:

    # reimu "Luck. General luck. All-purpose, everyday luck."
    reimu "運よ。運全般。万能で日常的な運。"

# game/case08.rpy:65
translate japanese press_reimu_1_48a22ace:

    # eiki "That is not a specification."
    eiki "それは仕様ではありません。"

# game/case08.rpy:69
translate japanese press_reimu_2_53d7955f:

    # you "Fifty? Who's counting?"
    you "五十人？誰が数えたのですか？"

# game/case08.rpy:71
translate japanese press_reimu_2_e6ebbfcf:

    # reimu "The donation box. It has never been this heavy."
    reimu "賽銭箱よ。こんなに重くなったことはないもの。"

# game/case08.rpy:75
translate japanese press_reimu_3_86251bb5:

    # you "How do you know they work?"
    you "効くとなぜわかるのですか？"

# game/case08.rpy:76
translate japanese press_reimu_3_e63e3b45:

    # reimu "Weren't you listening? Put this in my testimony. In big letters."
    reimu "聞いてなかったの？証言に加えて。大きな字で。"

# game/case08.rpy:80
translate japanese press_reimu_4_be18741f:

    # you "Did anyone check whether the charm owners actually got luckier?"
    you "お守りを買った人が本当に幸運になったか、誰か確かめましたか？"

# game/case08.rpy:82
translate japanese press_reimu_4_eada9422:

    # reimu "Why would I check? Fifty people already checked. By paying."
    reimu "なんで私が確かめるのよ。五十人がもう確かめたわ。お金を払って。"

# game/case08.rpy:84
translate japanese press_reimu_4_21eecc84:

    # eiki "Paying is not checking."
    eiki "払うことは確かめることではありません。"

# game/case08.rpy:95
translate japanese case8_3af4f096:

    # eiki "Order. The Higan Court of Logic is in session."
    eiki "静粛に。彼岸論理法廷を開廷します。"

# game/case08.rpy:97
translate japanese case8_0d42250e:

    # eiki "Komachi."
    eiki "小町。"

# game/case08.rpy:98
translate japanese case8_cdc3345c:

    # komachi "Defendant's here, boss. She's selling charms in the waiting room."
    komachi "被告人が来ましたよ、四季様。待合室でお守りを売ってます。"

# game/case08.rpy:99
translate japanese case8_ac34ad81:

    # eiki "Confiscate them."
    eiki "没収しなさい。"

# game/case08.rpy:100
translate japanese case8_24b6a586:

    # komachi "Bought three. Is my luck supposed to feel this ordinary?"
    komachi "三つ買いました。運ってこんなに普通な感じなんですか？"

# game/case08.rpy:103
translate japanese case8_94da9e7a:

    # reimu "Reimu Hakurei, shrine maiden. Make it quick. The donation box doesn't fill itself."
    reimu "博麗神社の巫女、博麗霊夢よ。手短にね。賽銭箱は勝手に埋まらないんだから。"

# game/case08.rpy:106
translate japanese case8_cd2b47c9:

    # eiki "The charge: selling lucky charms that do not work to half the Human Village."
    eiki "罪状：効かないお守りを人間の里の半分に売りつけたこと。"

# game/case08.rpy:109
translate japanese case8_a3a55d86:

    # reimu "They work. Ask anyone. Ask everyone."
    reimu "効くわよ。誰にでも聞いて。みんなに聞いて。"

# game/case08.rpy:113
translate japanese case8_f3b29ff0:

    # eiki "Junior Judge. A crowd can be loud. That does not make it right."
    eiki "見習い判事。群衆の声は大きくなりえます。だからといって正しいわけではありません。"

# game/case08.rpy:114
translate japanese case8_f5c5ac8c:

    # eiki "Count the votes if you like. Then go and check the facts anyway."
    eiki "票を数えたければ数えなさい。それでも事実は確かめに行きなさい。"

# game/case08.rpy:130
translate japanese case8_5ed7189e:

    # reimu_t "Last week I started selling Hakurei Lucky Charms. One hundred yen each."
    reimu_t "先週から博麗のお守りを売り始めたの。一つ百円。"

# game/case08.rpy:131
translate japanese case8_52a20e15:

    # reimu_t "Fifty villagers have bought one already. The rest are on a waiting list."
    reimu_t "里の人がもう五十人買ったわ。残りは順番待ちよ。"

# game/case08.rpy:132
translate japanese case8_9b296754:

    # reimu_t "So there's no question about it. The charms work."
    reimu_t "だから疑う余地はないの。お守りは効くのよ。"

# game/case08.rpy:136
translate japanese case8_19f74238:

    # eiki "Your witness, Junior Judge. Keep your wallet in your pocket."
    eiki "証人をどうぞ、見習い判事。財布はしまっておくように。"

# game/case08.rpy:150
translate japanese case8_cross_3828e28d:

    # eiki "Again. Komachi, stop buying charms."
    eiki "もう一度。小町、お守りを買うのはやめなさい。"

# game/case08.rpy:161
translate japanese case8_breakthrough_aa714668:

    # you "Fifty people bought a charm. Not one of them got any luckier."
    you "五十人がお守りを買いました。誰一人として幸運になっていません。"

# game/case08.rpy:162
translate japanese case8_breakthrough_cfe64044:

    # you "A crowd buying something proves it sells. It doesn't prove it works."
    you "大勢が買うことは、売れる証明です。効く証明ではありません。"

# game/case08.rpy:165
translate japanese case8_breakthrough_61377ace:

    # reimu "...Twelve tripped? Nine got rained on? ...Do I have to give the money back?"
    reimu "……十二人が転んだ？九人が雨に降られた？……お金、返さなきゃだめ？"

# game/case08.rpy:169
translate japanese case8_breakthrough_11ca0f7e:

    # eiki "Bandwagon. An appeal to popularity. A crowd of believers does not make a claim true."
    eiki "多数派論証。人気に訴えることです。信じる人が大勢いても、主張は真になりません。"

# game/case08.rpy:170
translate japanese case8_breakthrough_abb5e208:

    # eiki "Everyone once agreed the earth was flat. The earth did not take a vote."
    eiki "かつては誰もが大地は平らだと思っていました。大地は投票などしていません。"

# game/case08.rpy:177
translate japanese case8_breakthrough_516fedff:

    # eiki "Defendant Reimu Hakurei. This court finds you..."
    eiki "被告人、博麗霊夢。当法廷はあなたを……"

# game/case08.rpy:188
translate japanese case8_breakthrough_5114fdbb:

    # eiki "Sentence: refund every charm. From the donation box."
    eiki "判決：お守りの代金をすべて返金すること。賽銭箱から。"

# game/case08.rpy:191
translate japanese case8_breakthrough_8e63a634:

    # reimu "The donation box?! That's the cruellest sentence this court has ever passed."
    reimu "賽銭箱から！？この法廷始まって以来、一番残酷な判決じゃない。"

# game/case08.rpy:194
translate japanese case8_breakthrough_92179ff4:

    # komachi "Can I keep mine, boss? I've grown attached."
    komachi "私のは取っておいてもいいですか、四季様？愛着がわいちゃって。"

# game/case08.rpy:195
translate japanese case8_breakthrough_6063f5e0:

    # eiki "Bailiff."
    eiki "廷吏。"

# game/case08.rpy:196
translate japanese case8_breakthrough_ce8461be:

    # komachi "On it, boss."
    komachi "はいよ、四季様。"

# game/case08.rpy:208
translate japanese case8_breakthrough_5ea610dd:

    # eiki "The shrine maiden of paradise, on a refund schedule. Court is adjourned."
    eiki "楽園の巫女、返金の日々へ。閉廷します。"

# game/case08.rpy:209
translate japanese case8_breakthrough_11e232a7:

    # komachi "A first for the Hakurei Shrine, boss. Money going out."
    komachi "博麗神社始まって以来ですね、四季様。お金が出ていくなんて。"

translate japanese strings:

    # game/case08.rpy:10
    old "Hakurei Lucky Charm"
    new "博麗のお守り"

    # game/case08.rpy:10
    old "A red pouch. Inside, a slip of paper with one word on it: \"luck.\""
    new "赤い袋。中には一言だけ書かれた紙切れ：「運」。"

    # game/case08.rpy:12
    old "Donation Box (Full)"
    new "賽銭箱（満杯）"

    # game/case08.rpy:12
    old "Heavy, for once. Five thousand yen and a button."
    new "珍しく重い。五千円とボタン一つ。"

    # game/case08.rpy:14
    old "Village Complaint List"
    new "里の苦情リスト"

    # game/case08.rpy:14
    old "Charm owners this week: 12 tripped, 9 rained on, 3 bitten by fairies. Lucky: none."
    new "今週のお守り所有者：転倒12人、雨に降られた9人、妖精に噛まれた3人。幸運：0人。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "Fifty Satisfied Customers"
    new "満足した客五十人"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "Last week I started selling Hakurei Lucky Charms. One hundred yen each."
    new "先週から博麗のお守りを売り始めたの。一つ百円。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "A price list is not an argument. Though it is an expensive one."
    new "値段表は議論ではありません。高くつく値段表ではありますが。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "Fifty villagers have bought one already. The rest are on a waiting list."
    new "里の人がもう五十人買ったわ。残りは順番待ちよ。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "Sales are a fact. Look for what she concludes from them."
    new "売上は事実です。彼女がそこから何を結論づけるかを探しなさい。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "So there's no question about it. The charms work."
    new "だから疑う余地はないの。お守りは効くのよ。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "No question? Ask her one. Press before you object."
    new "疑う余地がない？では問いなさい。異議の前に「待った」を。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "Fifty people bought one. Fifty people can't all be wrong."
    new "五十人が買ったのよ。五十人がみんな間違ってるはずないわ。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "Close. But she isn't leaning on one expert. She's leaning on a crowd."
    new "惜しい。でも彼女が頼っているのは一人の専門家ではなく、群衆です。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "That would be one example turned into a rule. She has fifty examples of buying, and none of testing."
    new "それは一つの例を法則にすることです。彼女には買った例が五十あり、試した例は一つもありません。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "She isn't mixing up order and cause. She's counting customers as if they were results."
    new "順番と原因を取り違えているのではありません。客の数を結果のように数えているのです。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "She isn't attacking anyone. She's hiding behind a headcount."
    new "誰も攻撃していません。人数の陰に隠れているのです。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "Nobody's being blamed in return. The crowd itself is her argument."
    new "誰も責め返されていません。群衆そのものが彼女の論拠です。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "No chain of disasters. Just fifty people and one bad conclusion."
    new "破滅の連鎖はありません。五十人と、一つのまずい結論があるだけです。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "No either-or here. Just a popularity contest pretending to be proof."
    new "二者択一はありません。証明のふりをした人気投票があるだけです。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "Her reason isn't her conclusion. Her reason is the size of the queue."
    new "理由が結論なのではありません。理由は行列の長さです。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "She isn't twisting anyone's words. She's counting heads instead of results."
    new "誰かの言葉を歪めているのではありません。結果ではなく頭数を数えているのです。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "That doesn't show whether the charms work. Find out what happened to the people who bought them."
    new "それではお守りが効くかはわかりません。買った人たちに何が起きたかを調べなさい。"

